  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag1.16" class="h1">Thag 1:16  Belaṭṭhasīsa</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Just as a fine thoroughbred steed,</p>
              <p>with swishing tail &amp; mane</p>
              <p>runs with next-to-no effort,</p>
              <p>so my days &amp; nights</p>
              <p>run with next-to-no effort</p>
              <p>now that I’ve gained a pleasure</p>
              <p class="v4">not of the flesh.<span class="fn"><a href="#thag1.16note01">1</a></span><!--end fn cite--></p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <div class="note">
              <p class="notetitle">Note</p><!--end notetitle-->
              <p id="thag1.16note01">1. See <a href="../../SN/SN36_31.html">SN 36:31</a> and <a href="thag1_85.html">Thag 1:85</a>.</p>
            </div><!--end notes-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
